<title>CANADA: McConnell Dowell year net falls.</title>
<headline>McConnell Dowell year net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bridge Corp, formerly Cedar Group Inc, said on Friday that net profit at its 78 percent owned McConnell Dowell Corp Ltd fell to US$0.17 per share in the year ended from US$0.24 per share a year earlier.</p>
<p>Income before taxes fell to US$8.9 million from US$10.5 million in the period while revenues rose to US$254.2 million from US$246 million.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
